			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Jaguero Isle lies off the south-eastern coast of the cape. It is wild and thick with jungle, and its beasts answer to a great ape called King Mukla. Panthers stalk its shores. Few sailors put in here, and those who do find no harbor. From the island's beaches, on a clear day, the {link:wild-shore}Wild Shore{/link} can be seen to the north-west, and the tall ships of the pirates to the south-west. A captive once saw them too, and cast a message into the sea.]=],
		},
	},
})

