	},
	hint = [=[Climb to the top of the tavern that looks across the harbor of Booty Bay.]=],
	sections = {
		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Baron Revilgaz is the goblin lord of {link:booty-bay}Booty Bay{/link}. From the top floor of the tavern he watches over the harbor, the ships, the trade and the quarrels of the port. His own people call him the most notorious pirate of the coast, and no one who knows him doubts it. He is rich, proud and hard to cross. He also collects the ancient relics of the troll empires, and he will spend a great deal of other people's time to add one to his shelves.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Revilgaz is the law of {link:booty-bay}Booty Bay{/link}. The Bloodsail Buccaneers know that as long as he lives, they must answer to the port on its own terms, and they would pay dearly to see him dead. His agents watch the {link:venture-company}Venture Company{/link}, his friends include archmages of the {link:kirin-tor}Kirin Tor{/link}, and his coin reaches as far as the racing grounds of {link:kalimdor}Kalimdor{/link}.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• He rules {link:booty-bay}Booty Bay{/link} and keeps it open to every ship that pays.
