• He ordered Kebok to deal with a goblin who had begun to push aside the moguls of the trade princes.
• He sponsors the goblin racer {link:pozzik}Pozzik{/link}, and he sent for the plans of a {link:venture-company}Venture Company{/link} fuel regulator on his behalf.
