			title = "The Masters of the Hunt",
			hint = "Prove yourself against the raptors of the jungle.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 197 },
			},
			text = [=[The hunters of the camp do not share their fire with just anyone. Hemet sets his tests plainly: raptors first, then the swifter breeds, then the jungle stalkers that are hardest of all to track. The last test is a raptor called Tethis, whom Hemet himself has never killed. The one who brings back her talon is named a master of the raptor hunt.]=],
		},
		{
			key = "the-white-tiger",
			title = "The White Tiger",
			hint = "Hunt the beast that brought Nesingwary to Stranglethorn.",
			unlock = {
				{ type = "quest", id = 208 },
			},
			text = [=[When Sin'Dall, Bhag'thera and Tethis had all fallen, Hemet told the truth of his coming. He had not crossed the sea for them. He had come for {link:king-bangalash}King Bangalash{/link}, the white tiger, who had sent him limping back to camp more than once. When the tiger was slain, Hemet raised a cheer for the hunter who had done what he could not, and named that hunter a comrade of the expedition.]=],
		},
		{
			key = "old-friends",
