			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Zanzil's craft has spread further than the jungle. The goblins of {link:booty-bay}Booty Bay{/link} buy samples of his mixture, and one of them has learned to turn it into a strong drink for schemes of his own. Far to the north, the spies of {link:si-7}SI:7{/link} have learned that the trolls of Zanzil know how to raise the dead with poison, and that the secret has passed into the hands of the {link:defias-brotherhood}Defias Brotherhood{/link}. In {link:tarren-mill}Tarren Mill{/link}, {link:serge-hinott}Serge Hinott{/link} has studied the madness his poisons bring.]=],
